  <NAME>Targeted degradation of GSPT1 causes TP53-independent cell death in leukemia whilst sparing normal stem cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>Targeted degradation of GSPT1 causes TP53-independent cell death in leukemia whilst sparing normal stem cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>To investigate the effect of drugs that degrade GSTP1 on leukemia cell biology. Overall design: We performed RNAseq on MOLM13 cells that were treated with vehicle (DMSO), CC-885, or CC-90009 (CC-663) for 24 hours.</DESCRIPTION>
